00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:27.999
Show it. Show it.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:28.999
Show the chat room.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:29.999
All right. I don't remember, but

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.999
