00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.999
Seriously, it's such a masterpiece.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.999
How was it, hyung? Did you know the story beforehand?

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:56.999
No, I knew nothing at all.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:57.999
