00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:23.999
Just in the middle.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:24.999
Yes.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.999
Personally, there was a point in the middle

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.999
