00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:34.999
That's how I made it through.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.999
How could you hit such a precious face?

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:37.999
Oh!

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:38.999
So you do know.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:39.999
Protect the king. Protect the king.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.999
Exactly. Protect the king. Good job, good job.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.999
