00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:15.999
Uh...

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:16.999
Sparta...

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:17.999
The Spartan...

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:18.999
The king of Sparta.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:19.999
